OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'much loved' cyclist
OL,4,Akilled in crash while on a training
OL,5,Aride
OL,6,
OL,7,FTributes have been paid to a "much
OL,8,Floved" cyclist who died in a crash on a
OL,9,Fbusy Inverclyde road while taking part
OL,10,Fin a training session with fellow
OL,11,Friders.
OL,13,FIain McTavish, 46, was one of three
OL,14,Fcyclists in a collision with a blue
OL,15,FFord C-Max Zetec on the A8 in Port
OL,16,FGlasgow shortly after 19:00 on Tuesday.
OL,17,FHe died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
