OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'much loved' cyclist
OL,4,Akilled in crash while on a training
OL,5,Aride
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo other male cyclists, aged 37 and
OL,8,F27, were taken to hospital following
OL,9,Fthe crash on the road's westbound
OL,10,Fcarriageway between the Langbank and
OL,11,FWoodhall roundabouts.
OL,13,FThe 46-year-old's cycling club
OL,14,FJohnstone Wheelers said it was
OL,15,F"devastated at the loss of one of
OL,16,Fcycling's good guys".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
